{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48779","headline":"宗庙九德之歌辞 · 褚亮","name":"宗庙九德之歌辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇祖诞庆，於昭于天。\n积德斯远，茂攸绪先。\n维文应历，神武弘宣。\n肇迹□水，成功坂泉。\n道光覆载，声穆吉先。\n式备牺象，用□牲牷。\n礼终九献，乐展四悬。\n神贶景福，遐哉永年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48779.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48779","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}